          "headline": "Israel's election commission finds no evidence of fraud in last week's vote",
          "body": "Israel's Central Elections Committee said it found no evidence of fraud in last week's vote, according to WRAL, Newsday and The Jerusalem Post. The Jerusalem Post and Haaretz reported that the committee also found no evidence that election integrity had been compromised."
